From aa5fba31c6cc82eb7876e8c41f00545eac74d6b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chandan <chandan@medpath.dev>
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 11:25:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Billing page: UX overhaul per design review

- Merge invoice ID, date and priority into the page header (removes the
  empty banner strip); enhance workflow stepper with taller steps,
  numbered circles and a connecting progress line.
- Redesign patient card: outlined 'Edit Tests' button, visit/priority
  pills next to the name, and a detailed info row with icons and
  separators for age (Y-M-Days), gender, visit type, patient ID and
  referring doctor.
- Tests Ordered: add a scannable TAT badge per row.
- Discounts & Adjustments: split into 'Discounts' and 'Advance' groups,
  add a +/- stepper for discount %, an Apply button for coupon code,
  and currency-formatted advance input with a proper placeholder.
- Payment modes: larger icons, lift/glow hover and active states, plus
  adaptive fields per mode (cash amount, UPI transaction ID, card ref).
- Invoice summary: payment status badge (Pending/Partial/Paid), bolder
  Total Payable emphasis, and a Preview Receipt link.
